      "content": "the fires have finally gone out. everything is just... ash and silence now. i'm sitting here among the ruins of the throne room, and i can't even remember what it felt like to be proud. there's nothing left to defend, no one left to protect. the story just feels... empty. like the ink ran out halfway through the last chapter.",
